  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Circular Economy and Waste Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This global multi-country initiative supports Kazakhstan, T&#xfc;rkiye, Uzbekistan, Botswana, and Uganda to accelerate their transition from linear waste practices to inclusive, sustainable circular economy systems. Although the countries differ in context, they share common constraints, including rising waste volumes, limited recycling infrastructure, and fragmented stakeholder coordination, highlighting the need for a coordinated systemic shift.</narrative>
  </description>
